@api = https://localhost:7100
@accessToken = PASTE_DEVELOPMENT_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@requestId = PASTE_REQUEST_ID_HERE
@rowVersion = PASTE_BASE64_ROWVERSION_FROM_PREVIOUS_RESPONSE_HERE

### Development login (yalnız yerel demo ortamı)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "employee@crm.local", "password": "CrmDemo!2026" }

### Create draft
POST {{api}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Yeni ekipman talebi", "description": "Geliştirme ortamı örnek talebi", "requestType": 2, "amount": 1250.00 }

### My requests
GET {{api}}/api/requests?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=createdDate&sortDirection=Descending
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Filtered requests
GET {{api}}/api/requests?status=Draft&requestType=Equipment&createdFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&createdTo=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search title or description (combined with filters and server-side paging)
GET {{api}}/api/requests?searchTerm=bilgisayar&status=Draft&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Detail
GET {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update draft — rowVersion değerini son response içinden kopyalayın
PUT {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Güncellenmiş talep", "description": "Güncel açıklama", "requestType": 2, "amount": 1300.00, "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}" }

### Submit — update response içindeki yeni rowVersion kullanılmalıdır
POST {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}" }

### Cancel — her mutation sonrasında dönen en yeni rowVersion kullanılmalıdır
POST {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}" }
